ituation  certain environmental hazards can be  used to your advantage if an enemy is  standing in a pool of water shoot it  with a shock bolt to stun them or try  kicking over an oil drum luring some  enemies over to it and then shooting the  oil to set the ground ablaze here are  several quick little tips you can take  advantage of if you hold down the left  trigger while opening a door sebastian  keeps his gun out it's an easy one to  forget but press the right bumper while  moving back to do a quick 180 after  you've marked an objective on the radio  once the bastion puts it on its belt you  can still see the number move meaning  you can just look at that rather than  keep pulling out the radio those are  some tips that we found key to helping  us survive the world of the evil within  q if you have any tips of your own leave  them in the comments and make sure to  check out our full review thanks for  watching  [Music]
 

